//
// owner_key is matched exactly against p.owners, and buildOwnerPacks groups on that raw
// string. So Engy Said's six LLCs produce six packs, and Ritter-Krutop and Wisdom Holdings
// produce two. The 12-owner roster cannot be expressed at all.
